mpatibilidad y rendimiento óptimo.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Contras</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No se especifica el rendimiento en número de páginas, lo que puede dificultar la estimación del uso.</li>\n<li>Está diseñado exclusivamente para modelos específicos de impresoras Epson, limitando su uso a estas.</li>\n<li>Su precio puede ser elevado en comparación con tintas genéricas o de menor capacidad.</li>\n</ul>\n',NULL,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0,'out_of_stock','https://media.solotodo.com/media/products/1917082',NULL,'solotodo','found','2026-10-03 06:42:23',0,1,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 06:08:48','2026-10-03 06:42:23'),(5025,25,'6222122','R30780801','6222122','REACT FEE GC8 USB CONTROLLER LESS 1Y SVC','react-fee-gc8-usb-controller-less-1y-svc-6222122','Poly','HP Poly Service Reactactivation Fee GC8 USB Controller for product less than one year out of support, 1 año(s)','<p>HP Poly Service Reactactivation Fee GC8 USB Controller for product less than one year out of support. Número de años: 1 año(s)</p>','{\"Compatibilidad\": \"GC8\", \"Código UNSPSC\": \"81111812\", \"Número de años\": \"1 año(s)\"}',NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0,'out_of_stock','https://images.icecat.biz/img/gallery/fa4acf69b270adc38c49b5c16fd5a0265d0ed048.jpg','[\"https://images.icecat.biz/img/gallery/fa4acf69b270adc38c49b5c16fd5a0265d0ed048.jpg\"]','icecat','found','2026-10-03 06:42:20',0,1,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-29 06:08:48','2026-10-03 06:42:20'),(5026,25,'6222124','R86725801','6222124','REACT FEE G40 T 1Y SERVICE','react-fee-g40-t-1y-service-6222124','Poly','HP Poly React Fee POLY G40-T Video Conf/Collab System less than 1yr out of coverage, 1 año(s)','<p>HP Poly React Fee POLY G40-T Video Conf/Collab System less than 1yr out of coverage. Número de años: 1 año(s)</p>','{\"Compatibilidad\": \"POLY G40-T\", \"Número de años\": \"1 año(s)\"}',NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0.00,0.00,NULL,0,'out_of_stock','https://images.icecat.biz/img/gallery/74a11180446198d7821339b26fdc7b2330a1c179.jpg','[\"https://images.icecat.biz/im